## Conventions

- A service's source of truth is its code home (a path in a target repo). The page here describes the contract and operational expectations, not the implementation.
- When the contract changes, the service page is updated via a wiki MR alongside the code MR.
- Internal modules within a service that have well-defined contracts (e.g., adapters, plugins) get pages here even if not independently deployable.

See [`_service-template.md`](_service-template.md) for the per-service template.
